14
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,340
Once a subsidiary contract is signed

15
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,580
God’s Domain Node Connectivity

16
00:00:55,740 --> 00:00:56,900
The environment in my divine realm

17
00:00:57,060 --> 00:00:58,620
